%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/exchange_patterns_test.clj:532 (chained-filter-map-test)
testing: Chained filter then map with calculation
元の形: DW スクリプト
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
[{year: 2003, price: 10}, {year: 2005, price: 20}, {year: 2006, price: 30}]
  filter ($.year > 2004)
  map { title: "book", cost: $.price * 1.1 }
%%% output application/json
[
  {
    "title": "book",
    "cost": 22
  },
  {
    "title": "book",
    "cost": 33
  }
]
